You said I knew!

262
00:17:36,900 --> 00:17:38,997
I ordered you to get out of yourself!

263
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,577
We are in a very public space!

264
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:42,137
No can do, my love cup rendezvous!

265
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,197
Over Miss Claire!

266
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:44,277
Shots are not you fools!

267
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:47,640
All this behavior is undignified!

268
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:50,841
What does this mean we'll
be together forever now?

269
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:55,120
Well, that was certainly
an unexpected development.

270
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:02,640
Princess Manaria, forgive my impudence,
but this contest has been decided.

271
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:06,140
Indeed it has.

272
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:11,480
Oh, I love you too, Remy!

273
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:28,280
Thank you.

274
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:03,637
Thank you so much

275
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:10,720
for

276
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:15,130
joining us.

277
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:19,100
Thank you.

278
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:48,260
I don't understand.

279
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:50,860
Why are you returning to Seuss so soon?

280
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:54,396
Forgive me, but the First
Prince passed away suddenly.

281
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:56,697
Now the rite of succession
has been moved up,

282
00:19:56,780 --> 00:20:00,309
so I'm afraid I need to return
to my family's dreadful feud.

283
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,540
Besides, Rey shot me down.

284
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:05,297
What better way to recover
than a fight for the throne?

285
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:08,377
But mark my words, I'll come back
to bother you when it's done.

286
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:09,397
Or you could not.

287
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,310
Enough, Rey.

288
00:20:10,393 --> 00:20:11,713
You're being very rude.

289
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:15,595
I won't soon forget how much
fun I had with all of you.

290
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:16,670
Neither will I.

291
00:20:16,753 --> 00:20:17,779
Get gone, bewitch.

292
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:20,937
You really did put your
foot where your mouth is?

293
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:22,020
Serves you right.

294
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:23,237
Show some respect.

295
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:25,417
That is not the proper
way to treat a princess.

296
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:26,837
Oh, believe me, I know.

297
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:30,155
I'm just saving the princess
treatment for my princess.

298
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:35,193
Well, you look at that.

299
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,497
You two are closer than two peas in a pod.

300
00:20:37,580 --> 00:20:39,580
I'm too effective for my own good.

301
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:45,640
Come to think of it, I wonder
if that was her goal all along.

302
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:48,577
Is it possible that she
played the bad guy the whole

303
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:51,757
time just to push Miss Claire
and me closer together?

304
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:52,820
Hold the phone!

305
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:56,017
Even if that's true, there must have
been a more painless way to go about it!

306
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:56,930
Quick request.

307
00:20:57,060 --> 00:20:59,413
Mind if I borrow Ray just one last time?

308
00:21:02,300 --> 00:21:03,130
Farewell!

309
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:09,369
And like a gust of
wind, she came and went.

310
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:12,400
Now that that's over with.

311
00:21:13,660 --> 00:21:15,778
Congratulations to you, Miss Claire!

312
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,777
All that matters is that
Miss Claire is happy.

313
00:21:18,860 --> 00:21:20,217
Please don't cry, Loretta.

314
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:21,717
At least we still love each other!

315
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:23,597
True love takes many forms.

316
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:25,856
You love birds have our full support.

317
00:21:26,380 --> 00:21:27,417
Wait just a moment.

318
00:21:27,500 --> 00:21:29,897
What in the world are
you all talking about?

319
00:21:29,980 --> 00:21:33,737
We're talking about you and Ray Aren't
you two gonna invite us to your wedding?

320
00:21:33,820 --> 00:21:34,650
Are you?

321
00:21:35,060 --> 00:21:36,000
Our wedding?

322
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:41,680
Me, Claire Francois, a commoner's bride No,
I think I'd prefer to call Rey my bride.

323
00:21:42,060 --> 00:21:42,890
Wait.

324
00:21:42,973 --> 00:21:44,000
I take it back!

325
00:21:47,900 --> 00:21:49,960
Rey, I must ask you something.

326
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:52,940
Sure, ask away.

327
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:55,980
Who are you, really?

328
00:21:58,220 --> 00:22:01,857
You knew of a secret offering that
surpassed the flower of Flora.

329
00:22:01,940 --> 00:22:06,234
And I hear you neutralized an unknown
poison from the Nur Empire as well.

330
00:22:06,340 --> 00:22:08,117
Where did you acquire that knowledge?

331
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,700
I can't tell you.

332
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:12,880
Are you a spy sent by the Empire? I'm not.

333
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:14,040
Do you swear?

334
00:22:14,340 --> 00:22:15,840
I swear to Miss Claire.

335
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:20,620
It's true.

336
00:22:21,080 --> 00:22:23,460
My only allegiance is to Miss Claire.

337
00:22:33,940 --> 00:22:38,440
And my only mission is to stop the
tragedy that awaits in her future.

338
00:22:43,840 --> 00:22:45,877
You swear to miss Claire huh?

339
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:51,000
Well, coming from you that means
more than an oath to God ever.

340
00:22:51,660 --> 00:22:52,490
possibly could.

341
00:22:52,573 --> 00:22:55,057
Will you promise to look
after Claire for me?

342
00:22:55,140 --> 00:22:56,460
It's as good as done.

343
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:07,200
Say it again, pretty please.

344
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:09,165
We still go as quick as I tap.

345
00:23:09,260 --> 00:23:10,837
What are you talking about?

346
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:12,137
You know what I mean.

347
00:23:12,220 --> 00:23:13,537
Tell me more about how I'm yours.

348
00:23:13,620 --> 00:23:15,137
You're getting ahead of yourself again,

349
00:23:15,220 --> 00:23:17,097
Ray after all we just started

350
00:23:17,180 --> 00:23:18,897
you

351
00:23:18,980 --> 00:23:25,217
know you

352
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:28,740
started calling me by my
name and what if I did

353
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:35,660
Famous Claire I love you
I couldn't quite hear that

354
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:41,660
I'm in love with you and
I don't care who knows it

355
00:23:43,540 --> 00:23:44,580
I love you.

356
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,920
How many times do I have to explain?

357
00:23:47,120 --> 00:23:47,950
Help me, buddy.

358
00:23:48,033 --> 00:23:49,057
This is my way for you.

359
00:23:49,140 --> 00:23:49,970
Shame, woman.

360
00:23:50,053 --> 00:23:51,292
Give me your points out.

361
00:23:51,800 --> 00:23:53,320
Oh, no. No, please.

362
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:55,710
It's crazy.

363
00:23:55,793 --> 00:23:56,623
People are scary.

364
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:57,950
I love you.

365
00:23:58,033 --> 00:23:58,863
I love you.
